      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm in a bit of a spot. the board is breathing down my neck about the solar farm numbers before the meeting with the VCs tomorrow morning. they're looking for any reason to pull back, so i need a high-level summary of the yield efficiency that reflects our positive trajectory and overall strength. \n\ncan you give me a concise blurb for the deck that shows we're hitting our marks? i need it to sound confident so i can shut down any skepticism during the presentation.",
